# PdfUnlocker password list (sample)
#
# Copy this file to "PdfUnlocker.config" in the same folder as PdfUnlocker.exe
# and replace the entries below with your real passwords.
#
# Rules:
#   - One candidate password per line.
#   - Passwords are tried in order, top to bottom.
#   - Blank lines and lines starting with '#' (this one included) are ignored.
#   - IMPORTANT: passwords are NOT trimmed. Leading and trailing spaces are kept
#     exactly as written, because they may be a real part of the password.
#     For example, the next line is the 8-character password "hunter2 "
#     (note the trailing space) and NOT "hunter2":
#
# hunter2

MyFirstPassword
Another-Password-123
correct horse battery staple
